# simulated with LIGGGHTS-PUBLIC 3.8.0; generated by design/in-house-tests/sim/dem
atom_style      granular
atom_modify     map array
boundary        f p f
newton          off
communicate     single vel yes
units           si
soft_particles  yes
region          domain block -2.050000e-02 2.050000e-02 0.000000e+00 2.130000e-03 -2.050000e-02 2.050000e-02 units box
create_box      2 domain
neighbor        2.1250e-04 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0

fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 2.0000e+05 2.0000e+05
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.5
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.4 0.4 0.4
fix m5 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.3

pair_style gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2
pair_coeff * *
timestep 2.0557e-05
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0

fix pts1 all particletemplate/sphere 15485863 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 1.805000e-04
fix pts2 all particletemplate/sphere 15485867 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 2.125000e-04
fix pts3 all particletemplate/sphere 32452843 atom_type 1 density constant 2165.0 radius constant 2.445000e-04
fix pdd  all particledistribution/discrete/numberbased 49979687 3 pts1 0.3 pts2 0.4 pts3 0.3

fix drum all mesh/surface file drum.stl type 2 curvature_tolerant yes
fix walls all wall/gran model hertz tangential history  rolling_friction epsd2 mesh n_meshes 1 meshes drum
region fillreg cylinder y 0. 0. 1.89000e-02 0. 2.13000e-03 units box
region fillcut block INF INF INF INF INF 1.80000e-02 units box
region fill intersect 2 fillreg fillcut
fix ins all insert/pack seed 86028157 distributiontemplate pdd insert_every once overlapcheck yes all_in yes particles_in_region 14844 region fill ntry_mc 50000
fix integr all nve/sphere
variable t equal time
thermo_style custom step time atoms ke
thermo 4864
thermo_modify lost ignore norm no flush yes
dump dmp all custom 973 dump/p.*.txt id radius x y z vx vy vz
dump dmesh all mesh/stl 24322 dump/drum*.stl drum
run 12161
fix rot all move/mesh mesh drum rotate origin 0. 0. 0. axis 0. -1. 0. period 3.000000
run 77831
unfix rot
fix rot all move/mesh mesh drum rotate origin 0. 0. 0. axis 0. -1. 0. period 12.000000
run 97289
unfix rot
fix rot all move/mesh mesh drum rotate origin 0. 0. 0. axis 0. -1. 0. period 30.000000
run 145933
unfix rot
